{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"They scramble up the large tree and whisper to their cohort of spiders. ||\"Bring me the intruder.\"|| In a matter of moments, the spider emissary of Lolth is brought before Web, who smiles menacingly. They hold the spider between two of their fingers. ||\"Let Lolth know: a ransom is not the right way to get Web's attention. She had much better ways.\"|| They look into the spider's eyes knowingly. They know the most painful way a spider can die, and they do it to the emissary slowly. As it dies, Web whispers to it again. ||\"If she thinks I became too kind for her, let her know this. I am good, but I am not kind. I am not merciful. I am a wild creature. And there's a reason you don't back a wild thing into a corner: you get bit.\"|| Web grins menacingly one last time as the spider enters its final throes, then eats the remains.","created_at":"2020-08-13T09:40:45.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743403663778643968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
